  m_text: "To whoever reaches this point, beware. The next floor marks the beginning
    of a <color=#f91700>darker </color> and far more challenging journey. The light
    that once guided you will fade, leaving only shadows and uncertainty. The puzzles
    will test not only your mind but your resolve.\n\nEach step forward will be met
    with greater obstacles, and the deeper you go, the more twisted the challenges
    become. Stay vigilant, trust no one, and prepare yourself\u2014for not everything
    that seems real is. The darkness is your enemy, and the only way out is to keep
    moving forward."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79af5aa2d9f81be4080184a80363fcfc, type: 2}
